From d10f04cf95fd0016dfd8cd7f75b5f408bb8c511a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:40:55 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 18/28] PS2: audit fixes - strip-based texture upload, PS2-only
 RGBA path, tolerant SFX setup, no per-draw heap vector, D3D depth, gsKit pool
 512 KB, safer ma_free/audsrv writes, single SIF init, verbose logging flag

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019yH2brr5GjCGyCE62bYyXR
